5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must ensure the human capital exists to execute these plans, not just the money.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m worried the grant looks big but buys less. Who pays for the extra lab fees?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should check if past projects actually finished on time before we pick.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I’ve seen too many awards stall because of broken equipment. We need to know where work gets interrupted.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Shared infrastructure is the real bottleneck. If the facilities are full, the science stops.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, yes. But even if the machines work, who operates them? I worry about the hands.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, exactly. If the facility is booked, the money sits idle. I want to see the booking logs.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with checking the past. I want to see what the finished awards actually delivered.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I will look at the incident logs. If the shared instruments fail, the whole project dies.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will check the computing agreement. If the servers are slow, the data analysis stalls.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the staffing rolls. I need to know who is actually here to do the work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the travel and bench-fee lines. I need to see where the hidden costs are.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the closeout files. I want to see the final reports of finished awards.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will also check the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I need to see the failure rates.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities. I need to see the current load.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let’s see what the records say. The truth is in the details, not the promises.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the numbers don’t lie. I’m ready to see where the money really goes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think this is the right way to be careful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I’m not backing down. If the equipment is unreliable, we shouldn’t fund it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I’m confident. We need to know the capacity before we commit. Let’s proceed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
