35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The rolls show our technicians are gone, but the modelling analysts are seconded away. The hands are missing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The bench fees are covered, but the animal day rates jumped. That’s a huge hidden cost for wet-lab work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I looked at the closeouts. The projects that relied on live animals stalled the most. The data ones finished.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,I found the spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks. One engineer covers three institutes. That’s a disaster.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,The computing agreement covers simulation hours for free. But the animal facility is booked solid through two cycles.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, that confirms it. The animals are a bottleneck. The data work has the capacity.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, that matches my numbers. The animal costs are eating the budget. The data work is cheaper.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’m glad we agree. The data projects seem more reliable. I don’t want to fund something that stalls.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,I’m furious. Eleven weeks of downtime is unacceptable. We cannot fund a project that depends on that suite.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,I’m calm. The facts are clear. The animal facility is full. The computing is free. The choice is obvious.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"I’m not angry, just clear. The technicians are gone. The analysts are away. The data work is the only path.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I’m smiling. I found the hidden cost. It’s the animals. The data work is the safe bet.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel better now. We are making a careful choice. I trust the data projects more.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I’m still angry, but I’m listening. The data work doesn’t need the broken suite. It’s the only option.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,I’m steady. We have the facts. The animal facility is full. The computing is free. We should pick the data work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let’s move to the candidates. We know the constraints. We know the risks. Let’s choose wisely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m ready. I want to see which projects fit the budget and the capacity. Let’s look at the list.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m ready too. I want to pick the one that will actually finish. I don’t want to waste the grant.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I’m ready. I want to pick the one that won’t stall. I want to protect the science from the infrastructure.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I’m ready. I want to pick the one that fits the capacity. I want to ensure the grant is realistic.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
